      <h2 class="section-h2">Just paying<br><span class="accent">isn't enough.</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">x402 settles the payment. Trust402 attaches <span class="k">provable authority, identity, and scope</span> to that payment — recording who paid on behalf of whom, within what bounds, and against what data in a tamper-evident form.</p>

