          <h3 class="context-h3">Extending the "don't hold"<br>design <span class="accent">to x402.</span></h3>
          <p class="context-desc">Trust402 takes Lemma's trust layer and extends it into <span class="k">agent autonomous payment</span>. Agents are handed <span class="k">neither keys nor data</span>; only proofs flow. The receiving side independently verifies legitimacy.</p>
