            <span><span class="k">Role membership</span> — prove role assignment via Circom circuits<span class="mono">Groth16 / BN254</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="context-feature">
            <span><span class="k">Spend limit</span> — enforce budget caps via 128-bit LessEqThan<span class="mono">fail-closed guarantee</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="context-feature">
